02:00:28.351 --> 02:00:29.874
Lakukan saja.

02:00:30.875 --> 02:00:31.920
Lakukan.

02:00:33.835 --> 02:00:35.663
Ambil ini.

02:00:36.751 --> 02:00:38.231
